      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be great if group instances could be created with a minimum Trust Rank, so only people from New User (or User, etc.) and above can join. That way Trust Rank would actually be useful, and it would stop people from getting into events with alt accounts just to cause trouble.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
